# GET-only local examples. Replace variables in your HTTP client.
# Some GET handlers reconcile stored state; consult the API reference first.
# Never commit credentials or point mutation examples at production.
@terminal = http://localhost:8080
@frontend = http://localhost:3100
@token = REPLACE_LOCALLY

### Liveness (no authentication; not proof of data freshness)
GET {{terminal}}/api/health

### Stored source freshness; does not request provider refresh
GET {{terminal}}/api/data-freshness
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Configured TradingView connections
GET {{terminal}}/api/alerts/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Action evidence, including closed records
GET {{terminal}}/api/security-actions?includeHistory=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Portfolio shape and memo history
GET {{terminal}}/api/portfolio-history?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Existing Council jobs, through the FRONTEND origin
GET {{frontend}}/api/council/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
